  "id": "c3d9b24273a190ce2a86ea01",
  "title": "Android 中的 Activity Launch Mode 详解",
  "summary": "技术复核 · 2026-10-13。 本文保留 2019 年四种启动模式的操作记录，按 AOSP android-9.0.0_r1 、 android-16.0.0_r1 核对任务选择、affinity 与最近任务行为，并补充 Android 12（API 31）的 singleInstancePerTask。旧记录未注明设备完整版本，本次没有真机重跑，不能当作当前系统的逐步实测。 Android 中的 Activity 有几种重要的启动模式：standard、singleTop、singleTask、singleInstance。网上讲这些模式的文章不少，我这里写了个 Demo，想从任务中的 Activity 排列给大家看它们的区别；较新的 singleInstancePerTask 放在后面补充。 普通任…",
  "content": "<blockquote><p><strong>技术复核 · 2026-10-13。</strong> 本文保留 2019 年四种启动模式的操作记录，按 AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code>、<code>android-16.0.0_r1</code> 核对任务选择、affinity 与最近任务行为，并补充 Android 12（API 31）的 singleInstancePerTask。旧记录未注明设备完整版本，本次没有真机重跑，不能当作当前系统的逐步实测。</p></blockquote><p>Android 中的 Activity 有几种重要的启动模式：standard、singleTop、singleTask、singleInstance。网上讲这些模式的文章不少，我这里写了个 Demo，想从任务中的 Activity 排列给大家看它们的区别；较新的 singleInstancePerTask 放在后面补充。</p><p>普通任务内导航通常后进先出。下方 <code>A -&gt; B</code> 表示操作顺序；“栈内容”按顶部在前列出实际排列。留意每一步之后的变化，边操作边对照会好理解一些。重复发起启动不一定增加实例。Task 是系统管理的任务，不等于进程，也不等于最近任务列表中的一张卡片。</p><p>Demo 我也放到了 GitHub：<a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/AndroidLunchModeTest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AndroidLunchModeTest</a>。本次核对的快照为 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/AndroidLunchModeTest/blob/eaa1f987e332e0f85187a911ad9ae01cd20fff05/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>eaa1f987e332e0f85187a911ad9ae01cd20fff05</code></a>。工程 compile/target SDK 29、min SDK 26；源码包名为 <code>com.example.lunchmodetest</code>，与下方保留的旧日志 <code>com.example.launchmodetest</code> 不同。</p><p>运行前需要按每个案例核对所有跳转目标：快照中 MainActivity.startSingleTopActivity 实际跳到 SingleTaskActivity，StandardActivity 默认跳到 SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity，仅改一个目标无法自动跑完全部案例。类名 WithAffinity 表示旧命名，实际 manifest 配置为空 affinity；SingleTopWithAffinityActivity 甚至未声明 singleTop，不能凭类名判断模式。本次只核查代码，没有改动或编译这个示例工程。</p><p>下面先按同一用户、普通前台 Activity 发起、无额外 Intent flags 的条件解释。若把旧工程升级到 target SDK 31+，还需为带 intent-filter 的组件显式配置 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/about/versions/12/behavior-changes-12#exported\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">android:exported</a>，其中 Launcher 入口设为 true。</p><span></span><h1><a title=\"Standard 标准模式\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Standard 标准模式</h1><p>最基本的模式。在本文“从 Activity 发起、没有额外改变复用语义的 Intent flags”的条件下，每次启动会创建新实例。Manifest 中的 <code>standard</code> 不能脱离 flags 单独解释所有结果。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>android:launchMode=&quot;standard&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 Activity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1><a title=\"SingleTop 栈顶复用模式\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>SingleTop 栈顶复用模式</h1><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>android:launchMode=&quot;singleTop&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果目标任务的栈顶已经是要启动的 Activity 实例，则复用并投递 <code>onNewIntent()</code>；位于同一任务但不在顶部，仍会新建。这里的“顶部”是所选 Task 的顶部，不是整个设备只有一个栈顶。</p><h2><a title=\"测试1 ： SingleTopActivity 不在栈顶\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试1 ： SingleTopActivity 不在栈顶</h2><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span></span><br><span>// 4. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTopActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 5. 启动 SingleTopActivity：</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTopActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//这里由于第三个 SingleTopActivity 不在栈顶，栈顶是 StandardActivity ，所以启动新的 SingleTopActivity 时会重新创建 SingleTopActivity</span><br><span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"测试2 ： SingleTopActivity 在栈顶\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试2 ： SingleTopActivity 在栈顶</h2><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 4. 启动 SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTopActivity -&gt; SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTopActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//SingleTopActivity 收到 am_new_intent ，而不是创建新的 Activity</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1><a title=\"SingleTask 栈内复用模式\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>SingleTask 栈内复用模式</h1><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>android:launchMode=&quot;singleTask&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol><li>系统会按启动条件寻找可复用的任务；范围不只是调用者当前的 Task。未找到合适任务时再创建新 Task。</li><li>找到任务后，如果其中已有目标实例，复用它并投递新 Intent，清除它上方的 Activity；如果没有目标实例，可能在选中的同 affinity 任务里加入新实例。</li><li>原例中未声明 taskAffinity 的 Activity 继承应用默认 affinity，因此可能落入已有任务。这不是“未写 affinity 就永远留在当前 Task”，也不能说 singleTask 无条件永远在任务根部。</li></ol><p>Android 9 的 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityStarter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivityStarter.getReusableIntentActivity</a> 与 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityStack.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivityStack.findTaskLocked</a> 会结合组件、用户、文档 Intent 和 rootAffinity 查找。Android 16 的 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/ActivityStarter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ActivityStarter</a> 仍区分任务选择、清栈和实例复用。</p><h2><a title=\"测试1：SingleTask（Without Affinity）\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试1：SingleTask（Without Affinity）</h2><p>这里的旧称 “Without Affinity” 实际是<strong>未显式设置属性，使用默认 affinity</strong>。下面保留原文的操作与任务记录。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity：</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 4. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTaskActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 5. 启动 SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTaskActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>//栈内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//备注：SingleTaskActivity 收到 am_new_intent ，将其上面的 StandardActivity Clear 调</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"测试2：SingleTask（WithAffinity）\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试2：SingleTask（WithAffinity）</h2><p>示例中的 <code>SingleTaskWithAffinity</code> 实际设置的是 <code>android:taskAffinity=&quot;&quot;</code>，即无 affinity，类名容易造成误解。空值不能通过共同 affinity 匹配普通任务，所以首次启动、且没有可复用目标任务时会新建 Task；再次启动仍可能通过目标组件匹配复用已有 Task，并非每次新建。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 4. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTaskWithAffinity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 5. 启动 SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt;  SingleTaskWithAffinity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleTaskWithAffinity</span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"总结\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结</h2><ol><li>本例两种配置选中了不同的 Task；Task 不等于 framework 内部的 ActivityStack，不能据此说必定新建 ActivityStack。</li><li>从 SingleTaskWithAffinity 普通启动 StandardActivity 时，后者可以加入该 Task，即使其默认 affinity 不同。</li><li>从另一个 Task 再次启动 SingleTaskWithAffinity，可复用目标任务和实例，并清除目标上方的 Activity。</li><li>是否在最近任务列表显示独立卡片，还受 Recents 管理、排除标记与系统实现影响，不能只由类名或空 affinity 推断。</li></ol><h1><a title=\"SingleInstance 单实例模式\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>SingleInstance 单实例模式</h1><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>android:launchMode=&quot;singleInstance&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>singleInstance 的任务只容纳该 Activity；它启动的其他 Activity 必须进入其他 Task。对同一用户下的同一目标组件，系统会查找并复用已有实例；不能把它理解为跨用户、跨工作资料或进程死亡后 Java 对象仍“全局常驻”。</p><p>下面日志括号里的“多任务里面有/没有 Task”保留了我当时的界面观察，指的是最近任务卡片，不是 Task 是否存在；也不是 launchMode 的固定保证。</p><h2><a title=\"测试1：SingleInstance （Without Affinity）\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试1：SingleInstance （Without Affinity）</h2><p>未显式设置 taskAffinity，使用默认值。下方 StandardActivity 回到 Task 0，是该示例中的任务匹配结果；一般情况也可能选中其他已有任务或新建任务。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br><span>58</span><br><span>59</span><br><span>60</span><br><span>61</span><br><span>62</span><br><span>63</span><br><span>64</span><br><span>65</span><br><span>66</span><br><span>67</span><br><span>68</span><br><span>69</span><br><span>70</span><br><span>71</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>taskAffinity=com.example.launchmodetest</span><br><span></span><br><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容(多任务里面没有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 4. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容(多任务里面没有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 5. 启动 SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内： (多任务里面没有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 6. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内： (多任务里面没有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 7. 启动 SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容 (多任务里面没有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"总结1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结1</h2><ol><li>singleInstance 独占一个 Task，但不保证隐藏最近任务卡片。</li><li>复用需要匹配用户和目标组件；已有 Activity 可收到 onNewIntent。配置变化或进程重建仍可能重新创建客户端 Activity 对象。</li><li>从它启动其他 Activity 会走其他任务的选择逻辑，不是“永远回到上一个 Task”。</li></ol><p>例如，<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/am/RecentTasks.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 RecentTasks.findRemoveIndexForAddTask</a> 和 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RecentTasks.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 16 RecentTasks</a> 对普通任务会比较非空 affinity、基础 Intent 等条件进行条目去重/裁剪。这能解释为何相同 affinity 可能影响卡片，但不能仅凭旧记录确定每次设备界面的具体原因。</p><h2><a title=\"测试2： SingleInstance （With Affinity）\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>测试2： SingleInstance （With Affinity）</h2><p>此处旧称 “With Affinity” 仍指 <code>android:taskAffinity=&quot;&quot;</code>，即<strong>无 affinity</strong>。原记录出现独立最近任务卡片，只作为当时观察保留；空 affinity 不会取消 singleInstance 的复用规则。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>taskAffinity=null</span><br><span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br><span>58</span><br><span>59</span><br><span>60</span><br><span>61</span><br><span>62</span><br><span>63</span><br><span>64</span><br><span>65</span><br><span>66</span><br><span>67</span><br><span>68</span><br><span>69</span><br><span>70</span><br><span>71</span><br><span>72</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>// 1. 启动 MainActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 2. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 3. 启动 SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：(多任务里面有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 4. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：(多任务里面有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 5. 启动 SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：(多任务里面有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 6. 启动 StandardActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：(多任务里面有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>-------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br><span>// 7. 启动 SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span>MainActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity -&gt; StandardActivity -&gt; SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span></span><br><span>//栈1内容：(多任务里面有 Task)</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.SingleInstanceWithAffinityActivity</span><br><span>//栈0内容：</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.StandardActivity</span><br><span>com.example.launchmodetest/.MainActivity</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1><a title=\"Android 12 起：singleInstancePerTask\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Android 12 起：singleInstancePerTask</h1><p>Android 12（API 31）新增 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/pm/ActivityInfo#LAUNCH_SINGLE_INSTANCE_PER_TASK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">singleInstancePerTask</a>。它要求目标 Activity 位于任务根部，同一 Task 只有一个该实例，但该 Task 可以继续容纳其他 Activity。</p><p>普通重复启动可以复用已有任务并清除目标上方的 Activity；使用 MULTIPLE_TASK 或 NEW_DOCUMENT 等符合条件的启动方式，可以让同一组件在多个 Task 各有实例。它与 singleInstance 的“任务内只有一个 Activity”不同。具体文档模式与 flags 仍要一起看，不能把单一 flag 当成无条件多开保证。原 2019 Demo 没有实现这个模式。</p><h1><a title=\"Intent flags 与 onNewIntent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Intent flags 与 onNewIntent</h1><p>Manifest 之外，调用方的 flags 也影响行为。下面只列最容易影响本文实验的组合：</p><table><thead><tr><th>启动方式</th><th>影响</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SINGLE_TOP</td><td>目标已在所选 Task 顶部时可复用，不会自动搜索并清掉中间所有页面</td></tr><tr><td>NEW_TASK</td><td>进入查找/创建任务的路径，不保证每次新建 Task</td></tr><tr><td>CLEAR_TOP</td><td>找到目标后清除其上方页面；目标为 standard 且没有 SINGLE_TOP 等复用条件时，目标本身也可能被结束后重建</td></tr><tr><td>NEW_TASK + CLEAR_TASK</td><td>清除所选任务的旧内容，让新 Activity 成为新的根；不是 CLEAR_TOP 的别名</td></tr></tbody></table><p>这些分支可对照 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/ActivityStarter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 16 ActivityStarter</a> 与 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/Task.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Task.clearTopActivities</a>。应用从后台启动还需满足对应版本的启动限制；launchMode 本身不授予后台启动权限。</p><p>复用不等于自动处理新参数。按照 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#onNewIntent(android.content.Intent)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Activity API</a>，<code>getIntent()</code> 默认仍返回原 Intent；需要更新它时调用 setIntent，并在回调中处理这次参数。例如在已有 Activity 类内加入：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>@Override</span></span><br><span><span>protected</span> <span>void</span> <span>onNewIntent</span><span>(Intent intent)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>super</span>.onNewIntent(intent);</span><br><span>    setIntent(intent);</span><br><span>    <span>// 在这里按新 Intent 更新页面；业务处理也应与首次 onCreate 保持一致。</span></span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个片段只展示 Intent 更新，不是完整 Demo。记录 onCreate/onNewIntent、getTaskId 和操作前后任务内容，才能区分“新 Task”“新 Activity”和“旧实例收到新 Intent”；原日志里的 am_new_intent 是历史系统事件名，不保证新版本继续使用同名日志。</p><h1><a title=\"一些概念\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>一些概念</h1><h2><a title=\"TaskAffinity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>TaskAffinity</h2><p>taskAffinity 表示 Activity 与任务的亲和关系。它是任务选择或允许 reparenting 时的一个条件，不是“相同 affinity 的 Activity 必定同属一个 Task”。普通 Activity 内的 startActivity 可以把不同 affinity 的 Activity 放进调用者任务；同一应用也可以拥有多个任务。</p><table><thead><tr><th>配置</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>不写 activity 的 taskAffinity</td><td>继承 <code>&lt;application&gt;</code> 的值；应用未指定时默认是包名</td></tr><tr><td><code>android:taskAffinity=&quot;&quot;</code></td><td>无 affinity；dump 中通常表示为 null</td></tr><tr><td><code>android:taskAffinity=&quot;com.example.launchmodetest.detail&quot;</code></td><td>一个显式非空 affinity，不是 Task ID</td></tr></tbody></table><p>NEW_TASK 相关查找及 allowTaskReparenting 会使用 affinity，具体还要结合组件、用户、flags 和任务状态。它不定义权限，也不让不同应用自动共享进程。属性定义见 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-element#aff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">activity manifest 文档</a>。</p><h2><a title=\"ActivityRecord、TaskRecord、ActivityStack 之间的关系\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>ActivityRecord、TaskRecord、ActivityStack 之间的关系</h2><p>这些名称对应旧 AMS 容器结构，适合阅读本文历史图；不能原样套到所有新版本。</p><ol><li>ActivityRecord 是 system_server 侧的一条 Activity 记录。同一个 Activity 类可有多条记录；记录不等于应用进程中某个 Java 对象永久存活。</li><li>TaskRecord 管理一个任务中的 ActivityRecord。普通导航通常表现为后进先出，清栈、重排和跨任务启动会改变这个过程。</li><li>ActivityStack 管理多个 TaskRecord；ActivityDisplay 管理对应显示上的 stacks，ActivityStackSupervisor 协调它们。显示对象不是全系统永远只有一个，stack 数量也不固定为 Home/App/Recents 三个。</li></ol><p><img><br><img></p><p>原图引用的 <a href=\"https://gityuan.com/2017/06/11/activity_record/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gityuan 文章</a> 发布于 2017 年。第二张图中的旧层级可帮助理解容器关系，但不是现代多窗口结构图。</p><p>下面保留原文 <code>adb shell dumpsys activity containers</code> 的一次历史输出。图中显示 display 0、numStacks=5，已经说明“只有三个 stack”过于简化；其中 Task 671 包含多个 ActivityRecord，Task ID、stack ID、PID 是不同标识。</p><p><img></p><p>以 <code>android-16.0.0_r1</code> 为例，容器体系使用 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RootWindowContainer.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RootWindowContainer</a>、DisplayContent、TaskDisplayArea、<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/Task.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Task</a> 与 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/TaskFragment.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TaskFragment</a>。Task 本身继承 TaskFragment；root task/leaf task、嵌套 Task 和嵌入式 Activity 使层级不能机械替换成旧图的三层。旧 TaskRecord/ActivityStack 名称不是跨版本 API。dump 子命令和格式也按设备版本查看，本次没有生成新的设备 dump。</p><h2><a title=\"Activity 的几种类型\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Activity 的几种类型</h2><p>以下是 Android 9 <code>WindowConfiguration</code> 中的 activity type 常量，<strong>不是 launchMode</strong>。例如 type=standard 与 android:launchMode=”standard” 是两个维度。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>/** Activity type is currently not defined. */</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>static</span> <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>ACTIVITY_TYPE_UNDEFINED</span> <span>=</span> <span>0</span>;</span><br><span><span>/** Standard activity type. Nothing special about the activity... */</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>static</span> <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>ACTIVITY_TYPE_STANDARD</span> <span>=</span> <span>1</span>;</span><br><span><span>/** Home/Launcher activity type. */</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>static</span> <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>ACTIVITY_TYPE_HOME</span> <span>=</span> <span>2</span>;</span><br><span><span>/** Recents/Overview activity type. There is only one activity with this type in the system. */</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>static</span> <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>ACTIVITY_TYPE_RECENTS</span> <span>=</span> <span>3</span>;</span><br><span><span>/** Assistant activity type. */</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>static</span> <span>final</span> <span>int</span> <span>ACTIVITY_TYPE_ASSISTANT</span> <span>=</span> <span>4</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/app/WindowConfiguration.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 16 WindowConfiguration</a> 还定义了 <code>ACTIVITY_TYPE_DREAM = 5</code>。这些是 framework 内部的角色分类，不是让应用通过 launchMode 声明自己为 Home、Recents 或 Assistant 的入口。</p><blockquote><p>如果觉得文章有帮助, 欢迎分享到社交网站 , 希望能帮到大家.</p></blockquote><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</h1><p>下面是个人的介绍和相关的链接，期望与同行的各位多多交流，三人行，则必有我师!</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">博主个人介绍</a> ：里面有个人的微信和微信群链接。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/BlogMap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本博客内容导航</a> ：个人博客内容的一个导航。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2018/05/07/Android-performance-optimization-skills-and-tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">个人整理和搜集的优秀博客文章 - Android 性能优化必知必会</a> ：欢迎大家自荐和推荐 （微信私聊即可）</li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2023/12/30/the-performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android性能优化知识星球</a>：付费社群已于 2026 年停止运营，不再招收新成员；此处保留历史介绍。</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>一个人可以走的更快 , 一群人可以走的更远</strong></p></blockquote><p><img alt=\"微信扫一扫\"></p>",
